Credits

No third-party code is included. The request to "Notifications for Android TV" (Christian
Fees, dream apps; no published API) follows Home Assistant's nfandroidtv integration
(https://github.com/home-assistant/core, Apache License 2.0), its notifications-android-tv
library (https://github.com/engrbm87/notifications_android_tv, MIT License) and FHEM's
NotifyAndroidTV module; the icon sent with it is the 1 x 1 transparent PNG that library
sends. The requests to PiPup follow PiPup's documentation
(https://github.com/mhoogenbosch/PiPup, MIT License for that fork's work). No code was
copied from them.

Finding TVs (SSDP) follows Snap One's SSDP module as DirectorLink uses it
(https://github.directorlink.io, Apache License 2.0). Control4 interfaces follow the public
Snap One DriverWorks documentation (https://snap-one.github.io/docs-driverworks-fundamentals/).

The test fixtures in tests/ describe a made-up home; names, addresses and ids in them are
invented.
